# AICL Example: Card Value
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Face card to value

Layer:
Core

Behavior Value
    Input: card
    Output: result
    Action:
        if card == "A":
            return 1
        if card == "J":
            return 11
        if card == "Q":
            return 12
        if card == "K":
            return 13
        return card
